<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS2.SSS0.Px8" title="In A.2 Proof of Proposition ‣ Appendix A Omitted Proofs and Theoretical Results ‣ Best-of-Tails: Bridging Optimism and Pessimismin Inference-Time Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Part 3: BoN limit (<math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\to 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\to 0</annotation></semantics></math>).</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
